"⟪k:0⟫If I hadn’t been there, the flaxen-haired girl would have been able to let go of her "
"yearning for her brother."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Se eu não estivesse lá, a menina de cabelos cor de linho teria conseguido deixar de lado a "
"sua ânsia por seu irmão."

#: scenario9:scenario9_027B724C_BA77_45BF_A9B3_771705FE3179
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
